& [Why]
  + P0 closes what the runtime should contain but an executor cannot be governed safely until every future work item dependency denied capability unresolved reason and receipt boundary is explicit
  + compiling the work surface provider-free permits audit and adversarial proof before any filesystem process acquisition build or installation commission

& [WhyNow]
  + exact P0 implementation and bookend are remote equal, making upstream replay stable enough for a dependent signed contract

& [WhyBounded]
  + exact phases kinds formula and denial conservation prevent plan language from becoming implicit authority or unbounded workflow invention
